Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:04.14,Usaghi Main,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,Typhoon 13 is making its way north,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:05.48,Usaghi Main,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,maintaining its strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:09.90,Usaghi Main,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,The storm hit South Daitou Island at 11:00 PM last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:13.78,Usaghi Main,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,Transportation in all affected areas is now...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.32,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:21.04,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,The TV said the Shinkansen took a poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:28.59,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It didn't "take a poop." It's operating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:29.88,TL Note,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}TL Note: unko suru = pooping, unkou suru = in operation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:29.88,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Pooping?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.38,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Operating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:35.22,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably, "The Shinkansen is operating on its usual schedules,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:38.35,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,meaning it's running like it always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:43.39,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's pooping!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:52.19,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to go poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:55.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:01:01.79,Usaghi Main,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,Typhoon 13 has changed its direction and is slowly heading east,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:03.58,Usaghi Main,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,projected to make landfall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.83,Usaghi Main,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,in the Tokai region sometime later today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.38,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She said there's a typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:12.00,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay. Typhoons come every year{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:13.42,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:16.97,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Out of toilet paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:18.55,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Come see how much there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.55,0:01:20.51,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Get a ruler!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.51,0:01:23.52,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Boys are typically childish,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:25.98,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so I can empathize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.22,0:03:14.85,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pick you up early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.85,0:03:15.69,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.73,0:03:18.05,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.27,0:03:21.94,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:23.36,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:25.68,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:41.71,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Leaving enough space for these circles
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.71,0:03:43.26,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,means you've written it well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:43.78,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.21,0:03:47.09,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, how much is "enough"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:48.34,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.34,0:03:50.00,Usaghi Main,Boy A,0000,0000,0000,,How many centimeters? How many millimeters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.90,0:04:01.82,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't {\i1}have{\i0} to draw the circles!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:03.53,Usaghi Main,Class,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:07.70,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, the rest is homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.70,0:04:11.95,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Next, all the first graders will be drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.95,0:04:14.58,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Meet outside in front of your morning glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.87,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.87,0:04:17.54,Usaghi Main,Class,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:31.43,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Sandbags are so heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:34.01,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's only morning, and I'm already beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.01,0:04:37.39,Usaghi Main,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,It just {\i1}had{\i0} to be today when we've got so many samples to ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:41.52,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:44.30,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.57,0:04:48.01,Usaghi Main,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,My kids' educational insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:51.49,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They're still babies, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.49,0:04:54.44,Usaghi Main,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,If I wait until they're older, the insurance wouldn't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:57.08,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,T-That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:59.41,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,We're enrolled too,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.41,0:05:02.44,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,though I doubt my kid is suited for college.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:06.00,Usaghi Main,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,We have two, so it's pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:08.01,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Ours is still young, so we have daycare fees,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.01,0:05:10.01,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,which makes it harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:11.66,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,And he outgrows his clothes so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:14.97,Usaghi Main,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we're just contract employees, but it's not bad
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.97,0:05:19.15,Usaghi Main,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,since the welfare pension program and health insurance are included.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:22.15,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How about life insurance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:24.15,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,My wife took care of that in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:26.82,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,The amount is decent if I keel over,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:28.40,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,but she has universal life insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.10,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,The basic one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:34.32,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You guys really {\i1}are{\i0} fathers, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:35.83,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:38.06,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:42.12,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how much insurance costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:45.92,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,The brat next door is so damn noisy. We want to move,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:47.59,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,but we don't have the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:51.28,Usaghi Main,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even know what I'm working for anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:53.80,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Just look at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:55.45,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Get married, and this is what happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:05:58.87,Usaghi Main,Mayunashi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have a girlfriend, so I'm safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:02.09,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They're constantly complaining,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:07.15,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but deep down, there's a sense of security.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:12.78,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine them acting like Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.47,0:06:34.08,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:36.79,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:45.96,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:52.82,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your drawing board?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:55.89,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,The ground is flat, so I don't really need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.57,0:06:58.37,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,That's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.37,0:07:01.20,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,When I tell you to bring something, bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:03.21,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Go get it right now! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.71,0:07:10.96,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, your drawing is great, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:12.59,Usaghi Main,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it is! That's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.59,0:07:13.92,Usaghi Main,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:15.37,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:17.39,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,That really {\i1}is{\i0} good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:22.96,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,This flower's color and this one's are just a bit different,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:27.71,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,and Rin-san's drawing shows that using blue and purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:31.40,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,You have good eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.85,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun and those boys are playing around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:48.07,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:50.84,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,it's drawing time right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:55.20,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san, your morning glories are looking nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:07:59.05,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be a waste if you don't draw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.05,0:08:01.16,Usaghi Main,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san, do you enjoy drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.47,0:08:04.02,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Sort of, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:06.13,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Tatsumi-sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:09.44,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in charge of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:13.09,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san, why do you always cause everyone trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:15.36,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Now sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:16.86,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,And don't make that strange face!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:32.99,Usaghi Main,Boy B,0000,0000,0000,,I got Kouki's hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:34.38,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.09,0:08:39.30,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Kouki-san! Boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:40.51,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Stop messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.51,0:08:41.20,Usaghi Main,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:43.66,Usaghi Main,Boy B,0000,0000,0000,,I got it! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:49.73,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.19,0:08:55.05,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:57.57,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:08:58.55,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Stop getting into trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:06.62,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.55,0:09:20.80,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That was incredible, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:25.50,Usaghi Main,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun always does weird things, and he's scary when he gets mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:28.64,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, he'll bully you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:33.19,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, he won't! After all, we went to the same nursery school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:35.40,Usaghi Main,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.83,0:09:53.42,Usaghi Main,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,They're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.01,0:10:02.55,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You pick your kids up at 6:00 too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.55,0:10:05.05,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Cutting it close today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.47,0:10:06.91,Usaghi Main,Mayunashi,0000,0000,0000,,Here they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.35,0:10:13.10,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Let's get it done in one go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:14.19,Usaghi Main,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:23.35,Usaghi Main,Instructors 1 and 2,0000,0000,0000,,Good afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.95,0:10:26.24,Usaghi Main,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,Got a little wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:29.27,Usaghi Main,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, your father is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:31.33,Usaghi Main,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:33.96,Usaghi Main,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:35.78,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:38.40,Usaghi Main,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:41.45,Usaghi Main,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,The wind's picked up, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:45.47,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I wish I could've gotten here sooner, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.47,0:10:47.10,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Am I the last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:49.06,Usaghi Main,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun is still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:50.46,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:52.64,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,So there's a storm, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:54.94,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's pretty rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.11,0:11:07.49,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.49,0:11:07.98,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.41,0:11:11.16,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,A flying umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:12.96,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.33,0:11:14.40,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.29,0:11:20.71,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:23.62,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,See you later, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:42.18,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Want to walk home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.15,0:11:45.99,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.03,0:11:52.33,Usaghi Main,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but since it's already decided how he goes home, we can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.33,0:11:56.75,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know, but the wind is only getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:12:00.09,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll call Nitani-san to see if it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:03.49,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,To confirm, can you just hand the phone over to me after?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:07.13,Usaghi Main,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,Um, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:09.55,Usaghi Main,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,We can leave early too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.55,0:12:10.64,Usaghi Main,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:14.10,Usaghi Main,Instructors 1 and 2,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we're just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:36.96,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:38.12,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:39.58,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:49.93,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:51.41,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:00.60,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:03.61,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get you a towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:05.97,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The storm windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:21.98,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome! Let me do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.59,0:13:26.95,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Careful not to hurt your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:35.41,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's so dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.23,0:13:49.35,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You know, it's sort of like a secret base!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:55.08,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's in my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:57.04,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm rinsing now, so keep your eyes closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:04.67,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Now, dry the rest yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:11.87,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you have a huge back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:17.14,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.14,0:14:21.81,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening! It's Nitani!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.77,0:14:25.21,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:28.00,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz348.059\fscx137.5\fscy73.75\pos(294,101)}Kaga Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:28.00,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz348.059\fscx137.5\fscy73.75\pos(269,242)}Daikichi
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:28.00,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz346.014\fscx92.5\fscy98.75\pos(435,117)}The meat and potato stew \NDaikichi made is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:28.00,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(384,260)\fscx91.25\fscy116.25\frz348.578}Daikichi can also run \Nvery fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:31.82,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So you {\i1}did{\i0} get off work early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:34.24,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I did something unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:37.70,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all. It was really helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.70,0:14:40.69,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. Kouki got soaked on the way here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:45.08,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Really, I don't know how to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:55.16,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It suits you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:15:00.39,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, lend me your clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.39,0:15:02.77,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Again with that? It's "Daikichi-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.77,0:15:04.98,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,He said "Daikichi" is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:08.40,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm more comfortable with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.40,0:15:09.38,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:11.53,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Just "Daikichi" is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.79,0:15:22.29,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, you're really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:24.00,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can use a knife too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.12,0:15:26.88,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're already a young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.75,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi handles the fire, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:30.07,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:34.97,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You never help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:36.30,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cut too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:39.10,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll lend you my knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:46.48,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Dangerous! Onions are dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:49.82,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,No touching. Go wash your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.61,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.53,0:15:53.65,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no! I'm crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.49,0:16:02.02,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're making hamburger patties?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:06.37,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it looks tasty, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.84,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,These look a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:12.30,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,No, they don't! Do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:15.84,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'm sure they'll taste okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:19.34,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! The eggs are boiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:20.71,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Please peel them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.51,0:16:22.83,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.06,0:16:29.90,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:30.84,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're so good at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.69,0:16:34.32,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's really enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:40.39,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, do you love your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.16,0:16:47.19,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yep. Even though she's such an old nag.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:56.55,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,He has a sense of security too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:01.75,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This one's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:04.06,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You should give thanks first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:09.21,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.38,Usaghi Main,All,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:27.00,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, your chopsticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:28.69,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I know. I'm just clumping it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:42.79,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:44.64,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:46.85,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Food tastes better when we eat it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:49.98,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat here again tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:51.27,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:03.20,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:04.56,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish the rest later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:06.16,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:13.71,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,And then it smacked him in the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:17.71,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,He's so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:21.43,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I've never given him this kind of chance until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:24.30,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so happy about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:26.01,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.01,0:18:28.46,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I didn't... I should thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:32.77,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei said we don't need those circles!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.77,0:18:34.88,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Being able to see that face...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:37.90,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad I got out of work early.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:42.65,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's raising a child by herself too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:46.62,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Come here for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:48.04,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:57.34,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I think it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:18:58.78,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Should I call a taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:01.38,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:05.12,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you spend the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.39,0:19:08.51,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.51,0:19:11.14,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan and her mom spent the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.14,0:19:12.85,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That was different!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:18.44,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:19.86,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:20.64,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.03,0:19:23.28,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:26.11,Usaghi Main,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:28.20,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We had fun too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:29.02,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:30.74,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:18.53,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.30,0:22:10.74,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The typhoon's gone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.74,0:22:12.16,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.16,0:22:16.20,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:17.94,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.33,0:22:20.06,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,He's early again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.37,0:22:23.00,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.25,0:22:25.09,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.71,0:22:28.07,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.05,0:22:36.21,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to open the storm windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:45.06,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The sky's so clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.56,0:22:47.40,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.07,0:22:49.64,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, we'll be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.82,0:22:51.97,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
